    "summary": "The user prompts the assistant to act as a creative writing partner, helping to draft a manifesto for a fictional radical political movement. The assistant adopts the persona of the movement, providing highly charged, normative, and one-sided arguments that characterize the existing economic system as exploitative and the movement's goals as an objective necessity.",
